    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="74.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 74.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ne þearf se frige mid þam þeowan mæg gieldon, buton he him wille fæhðe ofaceapian, ne se þeowa mid þy frigean.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A free man need not pay kin-compensation for a [penal] slave, unless he wishes to protect him from violent retribution, nor need the slave do so for a freeman.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">A freeman need not associate himself with a relative who is a slave, unless he wishes to ransom him from a vendetta; nor need a slave associate himself with a relative who is a freeman.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ne þearf se frigea mid þam þeowan mæg gyldon, buton he him wille fæhðe ofaceapian, ne se þeowa mid þam frigean.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
